Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.77,0:00:08.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能夠忘記 你們讓我蒙受的屈辱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不許動！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:12.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不許動！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:17.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你要敢動一絲 {\3c&HBB8DF1&\4c&HFFFFFF&}絕對饒不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:18.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（隔壁砸牆聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘰嘰喳喳的煩死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}咸奶油（奶油也暗指蚱蜢,話說大家知道butterfly 奶油蒼蠅的梗嗎...）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:41.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,時機已到 現在正是雪恥的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:46.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給我等著 我虛蜢達大人 會把你們打入絕望的谷底！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（隔壁砸牆聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我適可而止！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才出夜班 睡都睡不著！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:00.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 這個混帳鄰居
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為這樣我就怕了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:07.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我會讓你後悔找我的碴！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:08.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:15.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 今天就放過你 撿了一條命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:17.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟糕！時間到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:22.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,必須去打工了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:25.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還剩218日元
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.18,0:01:28.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這個月要怎麼熬過去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:30.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:30.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.18,0:01:32.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！排水溝！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:35.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的畫書 是新作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:36.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:38.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是臭丫頭們...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:41.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,《公主的花園》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.79,0:01:42.96,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是公主系列啊 我可喜歡了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也喜歡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:49.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,都已經畫了10本了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一畫就停不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:54.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,希望大家都能夠喜歡...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:56.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定會喜歡的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.43,0:01:59.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你看公主都這麼開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.54,0:02:01.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜歡了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:04.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 就走畫書作家這條路吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:05.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:08.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意 真白同學的話 絕對能成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:11.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,會嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:13.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,畫書作家...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能夠當上...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:21.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼畫書作家？害得我這麼慘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:26.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要粉碎你這個夢想！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}蜢蜢！真白與歸來的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是用頭腦作戰的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:16.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,作戰計劃要不斷提煉再提煉 讓Precure們中招 確確實實地...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 打工的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:18.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快指揮車輛通過！都塞車了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:23.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨天窗市圖書館
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天這位小姐姐會跟大家講她創作的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:38.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫虹丘真白 請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（掌聲...）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:43.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,公主的花園
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:47.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,南國的公主非常喜歡花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:53.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在城堡庭院裡種了紅的黃的白的藍的 各種顏色的花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:57.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,公主在遙望著花朵的時候 突然想到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還要種更多種顏色的花
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這時候園丁說了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,鄰國有一種七色花
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}（露露倫倫倫... 看過花仙子應該都已經...）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（嬉鬧聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽話 噓...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,公主兩眼放光
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:23.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好想欣賞一下七色花呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？還沒講完呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 喂 別亂跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 繼續！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:47.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉 我繼續講
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:55.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那花已經不再是七色的了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:57.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是內心依舊是七色的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:02.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,公主也更加喜歡花了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（掌聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好有趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主很可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花很漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真厲害呢 能讓我們翻一翻嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:21.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（嬉鬧聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼好在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:39.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友的個性不同 他們屬於活潑好動的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:42.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是這樣呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,花 紅色的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢 好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:56.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 那邊有黃色的花哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,黃的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:03.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 我能去那邊採風嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:07.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是為了下一作做準備？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:08.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:50.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 你的東西掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？我重要的筆嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:58.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我是美術系的學生 孟達
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:58.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1230,975)}紋田
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:01.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,美術系... 你是美院的大學生嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我的志向是成為畫家！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,經常來這裡作畫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:11.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿... 喜歡畫畫 那肯定會對美大生有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:12.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在按我的計劃走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:14.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你畫的是哪種風格的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:16.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:19.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 好棒的畫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:20.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:23.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,噗 她信了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:26.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在網路上隨便搜的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:31.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來 就把你的畫貶到一文不值 挫挫你的銳氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:33.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜歡畫哪種風格的畫？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:39.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我還差得遠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:46.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我都什麼還沒幹 她怎麼就沮喪起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你是有什麼煩惱嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:51.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小空 是蝴蝶哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.12,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:54.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那是蛾啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就遇到了這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:02.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈！什麼啊？笑死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:06.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都不用我來挫你的銳氣 活該啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:10.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那就讓我來給你的夢想釘棺材板！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:12.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要當畫書作家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:18.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？真能當上就好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:21.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 就這程度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:25.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,當上職業作家 被批評了也是在所難免的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:29.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不想有類似境遇 也就只有放棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:34.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,也有人說過我的畫很無聊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:38.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,後來呢？孟達大哥是怎麼克服的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 還差一腳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:10:01.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,被人說畫無聊的時候 是怎麼克服的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:04.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼啊 我沒什麼想法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:05.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:09.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是有堅定的思想覺悟的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了被批評的思想準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:13.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,思想覺悟...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:14.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:17.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,桀桀桀！聽進去了！聽進去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:21.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒做好被批判的思想準備 就動手畫了啊 真是可憐的娃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:24.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定也不是為了什麼遠大理想才開始畫的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,快點放棄吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.71,0:10:28.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:29.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:32.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁 礙事的來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:34.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是孟達大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:35.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:36.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他畫畫可棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:39.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:42.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做晴雯麗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:44.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我也看看你的畫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:47.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可... 可以 我看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:50.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個吧？哦 白花花的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:52.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那塊畫布是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:54.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我一丁點都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:57.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,廢話不是嗎 一筆都還沒畫呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了假裝美大生 才帶著的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:02.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要快點矇混過去...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:04.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,鞦韆！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.20,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白也來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,來了 來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:09.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:13.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都說 好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家已經是好朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.20,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,鞦韆 好朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這丫頭要看到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:28.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！讓大伙也欣賞一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:31.58,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:32.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:34.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:38.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是美大生·孟達大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:40.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure全員集合！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:44.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我的真面目暴露了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不會 我的變身沒有破綻！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:52.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,畫了一副雪白的畫呢 你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:54.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,話說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:59.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是不是有過面緣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:02.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不 還是第一次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:03.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是錯覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:04.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,對對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:08.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈！有什麼東西在！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:10.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,盯著我不放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 是察覺到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不肯定 絕對不可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:15.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蚱蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:17.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:21.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,被看穿了！我的偽裝應該是完美的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:22.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蚱蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:24.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是蚱蜢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是蚱蜢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:28.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起抓住它吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:29.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這下我萬事俱休了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:37.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:44.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:46.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 來的好呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:47.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不 才不好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:50.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國不會原諒失敗者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,被抓住了 可能要被處刑！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:55.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蚱蜢蚱蜢 蚱蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在鬧什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.94,0:13:07.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:17.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,與平時不同！怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,與它戰鬥 就會明白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:26.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:27.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:27.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}OK！
