Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:53.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇！兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:54.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:55.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:56.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:57.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:16:59.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,實力不俗 這招如何...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:25.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好強...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:29.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,與亂暴獸不是一個水平的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:31.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那還用說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:34.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:36.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就像往常一樣戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管對手有多強 都不用疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:44.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 早就做好了陷入苦戰的思想覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:45.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,思想覺悟...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是為了保護珍重的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:50.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,算不了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:53.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥... 為了保護...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.40,0:17:57.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:17:59.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:01.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們齊心協力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙神采飛揚地上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:04.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,臭丫頭們在嘀咕什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（聲響...）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:11.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:14.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別瞄這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:15.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:17.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:20.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥 我明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:25.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:26.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:30.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:31.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等著呢！
