Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:20.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,序幕已拉開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:26.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,臭丫頭們 比以前更強了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:33.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,本來就未必是所有人都會認為有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:42.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（咕...）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:51.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:54.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 應該已經粉碎了那個Precure的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:55.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,活該啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:57.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？孟達大哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:59.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:00.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好想再見你一面的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:05.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？我並沒有暴露嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:08.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我要感謝孟達大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能讓我面對自己的內心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:11.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡畫畫書
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:16.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡讓讀者閱讀我的畫書
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:19.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只要還有一個小朋友喜歡我的畫書
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:21.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我就想要繼續創作下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:24.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我通過學習孟達大哥的思想覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:27.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,決定要成為了一名畫書作家了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:29.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:32.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達大哥也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.23,0:21:34.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,人生不如意事十之八九
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:38.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,向著目標努力的孟達大哥 我很佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:41.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我為你加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是第一次被人加油...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈！不不不...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不需要你的加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我做事 孟達
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.11,0:21:59.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,畫吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:04.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,以後也要多畫 盡情地畫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Prism哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,960)}稜鏡愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.01,0:22:12.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家試著跟我一起跳舞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:48.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴要當棒球隊的特別教練
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:50.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我會竭盡全力的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:52.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗肯定能夠大展身手的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:54.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,向著優勝 神采飛揚地上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.05,0:23:57.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 棒球是哪種運動啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:00.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:00.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴來救場！王牌與英雄
